    "why": "For each statement, the student must evaluate its truth by analyzing the mathematical relationships and reasoning through whether the claim holds (e.g., is 10 calls > 10 windows in earnings? Is y = x correct for Elena?). This involves justifying conclusions about numerical relationships and evaluating the validity of mathematical claims, matching the practice descriptor of making and defending conclusions about numerical relationships.",
